a number called kid is fork the process.
If kid is 0 then, Exit 3.
a number called got is reap any child in my process group.
If got is kid then, Print "reaped a child in my process group".
Print "status {the reaped status}".
Set got to reap any child in process group 2147483647.
On error Print "no child in process group 2147483647".
a number called second is fork the process.
If second is 0 then, Exit 4.
Set got to reap any child process in my process group.
If got is second then, Print "reaped the second child".
Print "status {the reaped status}".
a number called group is 3.
a number called process is 2.
a number called my is 1.
Print group add process add my.
